OL,3,AIlhan Omar says 'bizarre' pre-dawn raid
OL,4,Aon her home is forcing her to move out
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinnesota Representative Ilhan Omar has
OL,7,Fsaid she can no longer live in her
OL,8,FWashington DC home after it was
OL,9,Fsearched by federal agents last week,
OL,10,Ffearing her address has been exposed
OL,11,Fafter the raid.
OL,13,F"With the death threats that I deal
OL,14,Fwith, it's not, it's no longer going to
OL,15,Fbe feasible to be in that house and
OL,16,Fhave my kids," she told MSN NOW.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
